SNES Lite licensing notes
=========================

This directory imports libretro/snes9x2002 commit
5bd8bd6d449be8a2ef7909e1aeb2bd8c9c0da8cb. It is based on the Snes9x 1.39 /
PocketSNES lineage. The Snes9x notice below is retained verbatim from
core/copyright.h. Additional copyright notices remain in their source files.

This is an experimental, personal-fork-only integration. The upstream terms
permit non-commercial use, copying, modification, and distribution when the
license and copyright notices are preserved. They identify Snes9x as freeware
for personal use and require commercial users to seek permission. Do not treat
this directory as ordinary GPL-only Rockbox code or claim it is ready for an
upstream Rockbox merge until the licensing has been reviewed.

